// 018.2: multiple named Scenario blocks execute cleanly from top-level genesis state
// and remain individually selectable via `--scenario <name>`.

Fact item Identified by A, B
Fact active Identified by item
.

+active(A).

Scenario alpha {
  +active(B).
  ?active(A).
  ?active(B).
}

Scenario beta {
  ?active(A).
  ?!active(B).
}
